      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df09fe9b443833e3c13d1bf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1，达成了春季三冠！\n击退了所有强敌，达成了伟业",
